        "title": "Foreign and Domestic Arts Building",
        "body": "The largest exhibit in this building was from Japan, showcasing arts and industrial products from there. There were also numerous displays from other countries as well. This building was intended to be temporary, but was not demolished until the 1990s, after which a new building was built on the site with the design of the original as a guide.",
